      <rules>
        <rule name="Art of Silent Death" id="4c08-79c7-c8de-1be0" hidden="false">
          <description>Dragon Monks have become masters of the Cathayan art of open-hand fighting. 


In hand-to-hand combat, if fighting unarmed, they will cause a critical hit on a roll &apos;to wound&apos; of 5-6 instead of a 6.
If the Dragon Monk wields a quarter staff, only the unarmed attacks will cause a critical hit on 5+.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
